    "title": "What channel is Iowa State vs Kentucky on today? Time, TV for March Madness game",
    "text": "Updated March 22, 2026, 1:48 p.m. CTIowa State men's basketball will play Kentucky in the second round of the 2026 NCAA Tournament.The No. 2-seed Cyclones (28-7) are coming off a 108-74 win over Tennessee State. The No. 7-seed Wildcats (22-13) are coming off a thrilling 89-84 win over No. 10-seed Santa Clara, which featured a buzzer-beating logo 3-pointer by Kentucky to send the game into overtime.Check below for when and where to watch Iowa State's second-round matchup in the NCAA Tournament: Watch Iowa State basketball vs Kentucky NCAA Tournament game on FUBO (free trial)What channel is Iowa State vs Kentucky on today in March Madness?TV channel: CBSStream: NCAA March Madness Live app | FUBO (free trial)Can't watch? We'll have live updates at this link.Iowa State will tip off vs. Tennessee State on CBS. Streaming options include the NCAA March Madness Live app and FUBO, which offers a free trial.Iowa State vs Kentucky start time in NCAA bracketDate: Sunday, March 22Time: 1:45 p.m. CTLocation: Enterprise Center in St. Louis, MissouriIowa State and Kentucky will play at approximately 1:45 p.m. CT at Enterprise Center in St. Louis, Missouri.Iowa State vs Kentucky odds in March MadnessOdds courtesy of BetMGM as of Saturday night.Spread: Iowa State -5Over/under: 145.5Moneyline: Iowa State -220, Kentucky +180Iowa State basketball schedule 2025-26Below are the past five games of Iowa State's 2025-26 basketball season. For the full schedule, click here.March 7: Iowa State vs Arizona State, W 86-65March 11: Iowa State vs Arizona State, W 91-42March 12: Iowa State vs Texas Tech, W 75-53March 13: Iowa State vs Arizona, L 80-82March 20: vs Tennessee State, W 108-74Kentucky basketball schedule 2025-26Below are the past five games of Kentucky's 2025-26 basketball season.Feb. 24: at South Carolina, W 72-63Feb. 28: vs Vanderbilt, W 91-77March 3: at Texas Tech, L 96-85March 13: vs Florida, L 84-77March 20: vs Santa Clara, 89-84 (OT)Our team of savvy editors independen